p.src:
The factor $\gamma$ on the right is not an extra force. Since $\frac{dp^i}{d\tau}=\frac{dt}{d\tau}\frac{dp^i}{dt}
  =\gamma\frac{dp^i}{dt},$ it cancels from both sides of . The exact spatial equation is therefore again $\frac{d\boldsymbol p}{dt}
  =q\bigl(\boldsymbol E+\boldsymbol v\times\boldsymbol B\bigr),
  \qquad
  \boldsymbol p=m\gamma\boldsymbol v.$ The familiar form survives, but the relativity is hidden in the momentum.

